{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Larchie 是一款協助家長整理學校群組、繳費提醒、預約與各類通知的 App，適合不想終日埋首手機、又怕漏掉重要家庭事務的使用者。它會讀取家長群組對話，將容易忽略的訊息、表格期限與待付款項整合成每日簡短簡報。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-27.webp\">\n<h2>每日簡報集中重要事項</h2>\n<p>Larchie 每日提供簡報，只列出當天真正需要處理的事情；語音訊息會轉為重點，讓家長不必反覆重聽。分散的訊息與提醒會化成清晰待辦清單，並與現有行事曆保持同步。學校群組的重要更新會優先顯示，閒聊與感謝回覆自動退後；使用者也可自然提問，讓 Larchie 記住家庭日程與對話，減少重複說明。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-57-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-58-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-59-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-60-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-61-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-62-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Larchie</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:41:28.131124+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:36:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:57:47.071338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:37:41.198389+00:00","content_hash":"fb611d278687d5126b3d583aac9fec252cccecc38d7e07cee3387bdccf58a4d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}